# Vendor Profile Overview

## Key Facts
- **Company**: Apex Digital Solutions
- **Size**: 350 employees, founded 2010
- **Headquarters**: San Francisco, CA
- **Model**: Boutique firm with senior-only delivery teams
- **Partnerships**: Microsoft Gold, AWS Advanced, Oracle Platinum, Salesforce Platinum, Google Cloud Premier
- **Certifications**: ISO 27001, SOC 2 Type II, CMMI Level 3

## Core Capabilities
1. **Cloud & Infrastructure** — Multi-cloud architecture, Kubernetes, IaC, FinOps
2. **Enterprise Applications** — Oracle Cloud ERP, SAP S/4HANA, Salesforce, Dynamics 365
3. **Data & Analytics** — Data warehousing, real-time analytics, AI/ML deployment
4. **Cybersecurity** — Zero-trust architecture, SOC setup, compliance automation

## Engagement Models
- Fixed-price (well-defined scope)
- Time & materials (agile transformations)
- Managed services (SLA-backed ongoing support)

## Differentiation
- Senior-only teams (15+ years experience per Principal)
- Business outcome focus, not just technical delivery
- Knowledge transfer included in every engagement
- 98% client retention rate in manufacturing vertical

## Pricing Context
- Onshore daily rates: $800-$2,400 depending on role
- Nearshore (Mexico/Canada): 35% discount
- Offshore (India/Philippines): 55% discount
- Volume discounts for engagements >$500K

## Relevant Industries
- Manufacturing (40+ clients, $380M+ delivered)
- Healthcare (Oracle ERP specialization)
- Financial services (cybersecurity + compliance)
- Retail (data analytics platforms)
- Energy (cloud migration)
